{
  "url": "https://new.web.cafe/tutorial/detail/5e548t2m00",
  "title": "如何利用 Google 最新的 MCP 服务，将网站性能从 83 分优化到 97 分",
  "author": "布衣",
  "authorAvatar": "https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5e548t2m00_avatar.jpg",
  "tags": [
    "工具分享",
    "Cursor"
  ],
  "content": "<div>我是如何利用 Google 最新推出的 <strong>chrome-devtools-mcp</strong> 服务，把网站性能从 <strong>83（黄色警告）</strong> 提升到 <strong>97（绿色优秀）</strong>，获得更好Core Web Vitals得分，提升用户体验，利于SEO排名，下面介绍具体步骤：</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5e548t2m00_img1.png\" alt=\"性能优化对比.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">一、安装 chrome-devtools-mcp</h2>\n<div>首先访问官网：<br>\n👉 <a href=\"https://github.com/ChromeDevTools/chrome-devtools-mcp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://github.com/ChromeDevTools/chrome-devtools-mcp</a></div>\n<div>按照教程进行安装。我这里演示的是 <strong>Cursor 1.6.45</strong> 的安装方式。</div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">方法一：自动安装</h3>\n<div>Chrome DevTools MCP 提供了 Cursor 的自动安装按钮，点击即可完成。<br>\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5e548t2m00_img2.png\" alt=\"自动安装插件.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">方法二：手动配置 MCP 服务</h3>\n<div>配置路径：<br>\n<code>Cursor 左上角菜单 File -&gt; Cursor Settings -&gt; MCP -&gt; New MCP Server</code></div>\n<div><strong>操作步骤：</strong></div>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<div>点击 <strong>Cursor 左上角菜单 File</strong>，出现如下界面：<br>\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5e548t2m00_img3.png\" alt=\"cursor操作指南.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>点击 <strong>Cursor Settings</strong>，在左侧菜单栏找到 <strong>MCP</strong>，然后点击 <strong>New MCP Server</strong>：<br>\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5e548t2m00_img4.png\" alt=\"添加mcp界面.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>在弹出的 MCP 配置界面中，按如下填写（args参数默认不配置，如果有需要可以根据官方github中说明配置）：</div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-json\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">\"chrome-devtools\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">{</span><span>\n</span><span>  </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">\"command\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"npx chrome-devtools-mcp@latest\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span>\n</span><span>  </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">\"env\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">{</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">}</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span>\n</span><span>  </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">\"args\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">[</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">]</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">}</span></code></div></pre>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5e548t2m00_img5.png\" alt=\"配置mcp服务.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>完成配置后，<strong>重启 Cursor</strong> 就可以愉快的调用mcp服务对网站性能优化了。</div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">二、调用 MCP 服务进行性能分析</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<div>用cursor打开项目，然后打开 Cursor 的 <strong>Chat 对话框</strong>（快捷键 <code>Ctrl + L</code>）。<br>\n在对话框底部：</div>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div>模式选择 <strong>Agent</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>模型选择 <strong>Auto</strong>（其它模型也可）</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>输入如下指令（把 <code>https://developers.chrome.com</code> 替换为你要分析的网站地址）：</div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>帮我用Chrome </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">DevTools分析</span><span> https</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>developers</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">chrome</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">com</span><span> 的性能</span></code></div></pre>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5e548t2m00_img6.png\" alt=\"性能分析.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>执行后，MCP 服务会自动打开浏览器进行性能分析：<br>\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5e548t2m00_img7.png\" alt=\"打开浏览器.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>在执行过程中会弹出一些权限请求，点击 <strong>允许</strong> 即可（应该可以通过配置参数默认同意，等待后续研究）。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5e548t2m00_img8.png\" alt=\"权限同意.png\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5e548t2m00_img9.png\" alt=\"性能优化建议.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li>等待分析完成后，可以在对话框中引入 <code>package.json</code>、<code>next.config.ts</code> 文件（<strong>文件引入不是必须的</strong>），修改对话框底部模型选项，模型选择<strong>gtp-5-high</strong>（建议选<strong>gtp-5-high</strong>，<strong>当前效果最好</strong>），然后在对话框中输入：</li>\n</ol>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>根据以上性能分析报告对项目进行性能优化</span></code></div></pre>\n<div>接下来等待任务执行即可。<br>\n如果执行失败，可以输入 <strong>继续</strong>，直到成功完成。<br>\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5e548t2m00_img10.png\" alt=\"任务执行.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">三、注意事项</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>如果你是 <strong>Next.js 项目</strong>，并且项目部署在 <strong>Vercel</strong>，不需要 Image 组件的性能优化，请修改项目根目录下的 <code>next.config.ts</code> 文件，images参数仅保留如下配置（<code>xxx.com</code> 替换为你的图片域名）：</li>\n</ol>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-ts\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>images</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">{</span><span>\n</span><span>  domains</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">[</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">'xxx.com'</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">]</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span>\n</span><span>  unoptimized</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">true</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">}</span></code></div></pre>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li>温馨提示：本文方法适用于 <strong>简单网站性能优化</strong>。<br>\n不包含企业级或大型复杂应用场景。性能优化是一项综合性很强的工作，当前方法存在很大局限性。</li>\n</ol>",
